    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i keep thinking about that one time in high school. i saw this kid getting cornered by a group of guys every day for weeks. i just stood there. i didnt say anything, i didnt even look at him. i just watched. and now i feel like there is something just fundamentally wrong with me. like i'm actually a bad person at my core.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
