      "content": "but it doesnt feel like i just \"froze.\" it feels like i liked it. watching him get humiliated... there was this part of me that felt powerful or just indifferent, and that's what i can't get past. it's like i have this rot inside me. how can anyone say i'm a good person when that's who i actually am?",
